    <string name="boot_failed">Setup failed: %s. Opening the Android shell.</string>
    <string name="motd">\u001b[1;33mNibras Terminal\u001b[0m · %1$s · %2$s\n\nPackages:  pkg install &lt;name&gt;   ·  pkg search &lt;query&gt;\nPhone:     termux-clipboard-get, termux-battery-status, termux-toast …\nStorage:   termux-setup-storage  →  ~/storage/shared\nShell:     nibras-shell zsh|fish|bash   ·  SSH: nibras-sshd\nDesktop:   nibras-desktop (XFCE over VNC)\nHelp:      nibras-help   ·  swipe from the left edge for sessions and settings\n</string>
    <string name="shell_help" formatted="false">Nibras Terminal commands\n\n  pkg install|remove|search|update|upgrade|show|list-installed|files &lt;pkg&gt;\n  nibras-shell bash|zsh|fish|auto   login shell for new sessions\n  nibras-sshd [port]                SSH server (default 8022)\n  nibras-desktop start|stop         XFCE desktop over VNC (127.0.0.1:5901)\n  termux-setup-storage              shared storage at /sdcard and ~/storage\n  termux-* / nibras-*               phone API: clipboard-get/set, toast, notification,\n                                    vibrate, battery-status, torch, tts-speak, share,\n                                    open-url, open &lt;file&gt;, location, sensor, volume,\n                                    brightness, wifi-connectioninfo, download, sms-send …\n  nibras-reload-settings            reload ~/.nibras/colors.properties, font.ttf, extra-keys\n  ~/.shortcuts/                     scripts for the home-screen widget\n  ~/.nibras/boot/                   scripts run when the phone boots\n  ~/bin/nibras-url-opener, ~/bin/nibras-file-editor   handlers for shared links/files\n\nKeys: Volume-Down = Ctrl · Volume-Up + W/A/S/D = arrows, E = Esc, T = Tab, Q = extra keys\nHardware keyboard: Ctrl+Alt+C new session · Ctrl+Alt+N/P next/prev · Ctrl+Alt+V paste · Ctrl+Alt +/- font</string>
